<title>USA: DAOU second offering is priced.</title>
<headline>DAOU second offering is priced.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>DAOU Systems Inc said a public offering of 2,365,000 shares of common stock was priced at $21 per share.</p>
<p>A registration statement relating to the offering was declared effective yesterday by the Securities and Exchange Commission.  In the offering, 500,000 shares are being offered by the company, and 1,865,000 shares are being offered by certain selling stockholders.</p>
</text>
